    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "SETUP REQUIRED BEFORE ACTIVATION\n1) Connect Google Calendar OAuth2 credentials to the Calendar node. Use an account authorized to read the official branch calendar.\n2) The Supabase project URL and public publishable apikey are already configured for Manushyaa. For each Supabase HTTP Request node, connect an n8n HTTP Header Auth credential named `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_AUTHORIZATION_HEADER`; configure header name `Authorization` and value `Bearer <Manushyaa service-role key>`. Keep the secret only in n8n Credentials, never in this JSON or GitHub.\n3) Test with a safe calendar event. Titles beginning [DEADLINE] are routed to deadlines; all other events become schedules.\n4) Verify records in Supabase before activating.\n5) This starter upserts events; it does not delete Supabase rows when events disappear or are cancelled. Add reconciliation before treating it as authoritative.",
